{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jousting in January is a <span class=\"bb_strike\">goofy side project thrown together to pass the time while working on Parkour Posse</span> free for all arcade game in which you must strike the enemy before they get you. 1 hit kill. 1st hit wins. Game features include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 8 levels randomly selected at the start of each round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2+ players in local multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- An easy access Quit Game button so you can go run conveniently timed errands before your friends catch up to your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Melee weapon that can be thrown as a projectile (or left on the ground like a spike trap in one of those dimly lit parts of the map)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Movement in 8 directions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">P.S. You will be unarmed after throwing your lance. You'll have to go pick it up or lead the enemies to your lance sitting on the ground.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768520?t=1742878229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768520?t=1742878229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742878229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742878229","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jousting in January is a <span class=\"bb_strike\">goofy side project thrown together to pass the time while working on Parkour Posse</span> free for all arcade game in which you must strike the enemy before they get you. 1 hit kill. 1st hit wins. Game features include: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 8 levels randomly selected at the start of each round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 2+ players in local multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- An easy access Quit Game button so you can go run conveniently timed errands before your friends catch up to your score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Melee weapon that can be thrown as a projectile (or left on the ground like a spike trap in one of those dimly lit parts of the map)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Movement in 8 directions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">P.S. You will be unarmed after throwing your lance. You'll have to go pick it up or lead the enemies to your lance sitting on the ground.</p>","developers":["Magic Rock Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768520/header.jpg?t=1742878229","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256993513,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993513/movie480.mp4?t=1705873801","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993513/movie_max.mp4?t=1705873801"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256993513/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1705873801","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993513/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1705873801","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993513/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1705873801"}}],"name":"Jousting in January","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0"